Vitrail is an independent, from-scratch implementation. It contains no code
from Blender, BUI, Dear ImGui or any other UI toolkit. The icon set and the
logo are original artwork released under the same license. Its interaction style
(drag-to-scrub number fields, press-drag-release menus, pie menus, etc.) is
inspired by common desktop-application conventions.

Runtime dependencies (not bundled):
  pygame or pygame-ce  - LGPL-2.1
  moderngl             - MIT
